{"seq":4,"slug":"project-structure","title":"项目结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/project-structure","wordCount":914,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目结构\">项目结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 的项目结构围绕三层划分与一条依赖方向规则展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>是否发布到 npm</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>apps/</code></td>\n<td>可独立部署的应用</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Next.js 站点、API 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>packages/</code></td>\n<td>被多方复用的库</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>UI 组件库、工具函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tooling/</code></td>\n<td>内部工程配置</td>\n<td>通常不发布</td>\n<td>ESLint config、TS config</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>贯穿三层的是<strong>单向依赖规则</strong>：依赖只能从上层流向下层（apps → packages → tooling），下层绝不能反向依赖上层。包命名遵循 npm scope + kebab-case，目录名与包名后缀保持一致；每个包的 <code>package.json</code> 则通过 <code>exports</code> 定义公开入口，通过 <code>publishConfig</code> 区分开发与发布两种形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-目录设计原则\">Monorepo 目录设计原则</h2><p>Monorepo 的目录结构是整个工程实践的&quot;骨架&quot;。一个好的结构应该让新加入的开发者在几分钟内理解仓库的全貌，让工具链能自动发现和处理每个包，让代码的归属和边界一目了然。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    ROOT[monorepo-root/]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; APPS[apps/&lt;br/&gt;可部署的应用]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; PKGS[packages/&lt;br/&gt;共享的库]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; TOOLS[tooling/&lt;br/&gt;内部工具和配置]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; CONFIG[根配置文件]&#10;&#10;    APPS --&gt; WEB[web/]&#10;    APPS --&gt; ADMIN[admin/]&#10;    APPS --&gt; DOCS[docs/]&#10;&#10;    PKGS --&gt; UI[ui/]&#10;    PKGS --&gt; UTILS[utils/]&#10;    PKGS --&gt; TYPES[types/]&#10;&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; TSCONFIG[tsconfig/]&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; ESLINT[eslint-config/]\">graph TB\n    ROOT[monorepo-root/]\n    ROOT --&gt; APPS[apps/&lt;br/&gt;可部署的应用]\n    ROOT --&gt; PKGS[packages/&lt;br/&gt;共享的库]\n    ROOT --&gt; TOOLS[tooling/&lt;br/&gt;内部工具和配置]\n    ROOT --&gt; CONFIG[根配置文件]\n\n    APPS --&gt; WEB[web/]\n    APPS --&gt; ADMIN[admin/]\n    APPS --&gt; DOCS[docs/]\n\n    PKGS --&gt; UI[ui/]\n    PKGS --&gt; UTILS[utils/]\n    PKGS --&gt; TYPES[types/]\n\n    TOOLS --&gt; TSCONFIG[tsconfig/]\n    TOOLS --&gt; ESLINT[eslint-config/]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"标准目录布局\">标准目录布局</h2><p>一个典型的 TypeScript Monorepo 目录结构如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-monorepo/&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   ├── web/                        # Next.js 主站&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   ├── public/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   ├── admin/                      # 管理后台&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   └── api/                        # 后端服务&#10;│       ├── src/&#10;│       ├── package.json&#10;│       └── tsconfig.json&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── ui/                         # 共享 UI 组件库&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   ├── utils/                      # 通用工具函数&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   └── types/                      # 共享类型定义&#10;│       ├── src/&#10;│       ├── package.json&#10;│       └── tsconfig.json&#10;├── tooling/&#10;│   ├── tsconfig/                   # 共享 TS 配置&#10;│   │   ├── base.json&#10;│   │   ├── react.json&#10;│   │   ├── node.json&#10;│   │   └── package.json&#10;│   └── eslint-config/              # 共享 ESLint 配置&#10;│       ├── base.js&#10;│       ├── react.js&#10;│       └── package.json&#10;├── .github/&#10;│   └── workflows/&#10;│       └── ci.yml&#10;├── package.json&#10;├── pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;├── turbo.json&#10;└── tsconfig.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-monorepo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── web/                        # Next.js 主站</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── public/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── admin/                      # 管理后台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api/                        # 后端服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui/                         # 共享 UI 组件库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── utils/                      # 通用工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── types/                      # 共享类型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tooling/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── tsconfig/                   # 共享 TS 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── base.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── react.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── node.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── eslint-config/              # 共享 ESLint 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── base.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── react.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .github/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── workflows/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── turbo.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── tsconfig.json</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 将配置包放在 <code>tooling/</code> 目录而非 <code>packages/</code> 中，可以清晰地区分&quot;面向业务的共享代码&quot;和&quot;面向工程的内部工具&quot;。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"apps-与-packages-的分层逻辑\">apps 与 packages 的分层逻辑</h2><p><strong>apps</strong> 和 <strong>packages</strong> 的分层是 Monorepo 最基本的组织原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>apps/</th>\n<th>packages/</th>\n<th>tooling/</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义</td>\n<td>可独立部署的应用</td>\n<td>被多方复用的库</td>\n<td>内部工程配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否发布到 npm</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>通常不发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否有 <code>main</code> 入口</td>\n<td>有（启动脚本）</td>\n<td>有（库导出）</td>\n<td>有（配置导出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖方向</td>\n<td>依赖 packages</td>\n<td>可依赖其他 packages</td>\n<td>被所有包引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>示例</td>\n<td>Next.js 站点、API 服务</td>\n<td>UI 组件库、工具函数</td>\n<td>ESLint config、TS config</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键规则：<strong>依赖只能从上层流向下层</strong>。apps 可以依赖 packages，packages 之间可以互相依赖，但 packages 绝不能依赖 apps。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 依赖方向&#10;        direction TB&#10;        L1[apps/] --&gt;|可以依赖| L2[packages/]&#10;        L2 --&gt;|可以依赖| L3[tooling/]&#10;        L1 --&gt;|可以依赖| L3&#10;        L2 -.-&gt;|禁止依赖| L1&#10;        L3 -.-&gt;|禁止依赖| L1&#10;        L3 -.-&gt;|禁止依赖| L2&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 依赖方向\n        direction TB\n        L1[apps/] --&gt;|可以依赖| L2[packages/]\n        L2 --&gt;|可以依赖| L3[tooling/]\n        L1 --&gt;|可以依赖| L3\n        L2 -.-&gt;|禁止依赖| L1\n        L3 -.-&gt;|禁止依赖| L1\n        L3 -.-&gt;|禁止依赖| L2\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"包命名约定\">包命名约定</h2><p>统一的命名约定让包的用途和归属一目了然：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/types&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/eslint-config&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/tsconfig&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/admin&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/eslint-config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/tsconfig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/admin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约定</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使用 npm scope</td>\n<td>避免命名冲突，标识归属</td>\n<td><code>@myorg/ui</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kebab-case</td>\n<td>包名全小写，连字符分隔</td>\n<td><code>eslint-config</code> 而非 <code>eslintConfig</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能导向</td>\n<td>包名反映其职责</td>\n<td><code>ui</code>、<code>utils</code>、<code>types</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录名 = 包名后缀</td>\n<td>目录名与 scope 后的部分一致</td>\n<td><code>packages/ui</code> → <code>@myorg/ui</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"package-json-设计\">package.json 设计</h2><p>每个包的 <code>package.json</code> 是其&quot;身份证&quot;，关键字段设计直接影响依赖解析、构建和发布：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.mjs&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./button&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/button.d.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/button.mjs&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.mjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;dist&quot;],&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;tsup&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;tsup --watch&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: &quot;tsc --noEmit&quot;,&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: &quot;vitest run&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;peerDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.0.0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/tsconfig&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.3.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;tsup&quot;: &quot;^8.0.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;^5.7.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.cjs\"</span></sp