为 <code>true</code>，不发布的包也设为 <code>true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>type</code></td>\n<td>模块类型</td>\n<td>推荐 <code>&quot;module&quot;</code> (ESM)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sideEffects</code></td>\n<td>是否有副作用</td>\n<td>设为 <code>false</code> 以启用 tree-shaking</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内部包的开发模式入口\">内部包的开发模式入口</h2><p>在 Monorepo 内部，包通常不需要先构建再使用。可以配置 <strong>开发模式入口</strong>，让消费方直接引用源码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span