<span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 开发时指向源码让修改即时生效，<code>publishConfig</code> 在发布时覆盖 <code>exports</code>，指向构建产物。这是 Monorepo 中非常实用的模式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"根目录配置文件\">根目录配置文件</h2><p>根目录是 Monorepo 的&quot;控制中心&quot;，承载全局配置和任务编排：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;packageManager&quot;: &quot;pnpm@9.15.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;turbo run build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;turbo run dev --parallel&quot;,&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: &quot;turbo run test&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: &quot;turbo run typecheck&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: &quot;turbo run lint&quot;,&#10;    &quot;clean&quot;: &quot;turbo run clean &amp;&amp; rm -rf node_modules&quot;,&#10;    &quot;format&quot;: &quot;prettier --write \\&quot;**/*.{ts,tsx,md,json}\\&quot;&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;prettier&quot;: &quot;^3.4.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;turbo&quot;: &quot;^2.4.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packageManager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm@9.15.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run dev --parallel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"clean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run clean &#x26;&#x26; rm -rf node_modules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">**/*.{ts,tsx,md,json}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"devDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prettier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^3.4.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"turbo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^2.4.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((项目结构))&#10;    目录分层&#10;      apps 应用层&#10;      packages 共享层&#10;      tooling 工具层&#10;    命名约定&#10;      npm scope&#10;      kebab-case&#10;      功能导向&#10;    package.json&#10;      exports 入口&#10;      files 发布范围&#10;      publishConfig 覆盖&#10;    依赖方向&#10;      上层依赖下层&#10;      禁止反向依赖\">mindmap\n  root((项目结构))\n    目录分层\n      apps 应用层\n      packages 共享层\n      tooling 工具层\n    命名约定\n      npm scope\n      kebab-case\n      功能导向\n    package.json\n      exports 入口\n      files 发布范围\n      publishConfig 覆盖\n    依赖方向\n      上层依赖下层\n      禁止反向依赖</pre><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 的标准分层为 apps（可部署应用）、packages（共享库）和 tooling（工程配置）</li>\n<li>依赖方向必须从上层流向下层：apps → packages → tooling，禁止反向依赖</li>\n<li>包命名使用 npm scope + kebab-case，目录名与包名后缀保持一致</li>\n<li><code>exports</code> 字段是现代包入口的标准，应替代传统的 <code>main</code> 字段</li>\n<li>开发模式下包可以直接指向源码，通过 <code>publishConfig</code> 在发布时切换到构建产物</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"项目结构","id":"项目结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 目录设计原则","id":"monorepo-目录设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"标准目录布局","id":"标准目录布局"},{"level":2,"text":"apps 与 packages 的分层逻辑","id":"apps-与-packages-的分层逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"包命名约定","id":"包命名约定"},{"level":2,"text":"package.json 设计","id":"package-json-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"关键字段说明","id":"关键字段说明"},{"level":2,"text":"内部包的开发模式入口","id":"内部包的开发模式入口"},{"level":2,"text":"根目录配置文件","id":"根目录配置文件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/dependency-management"},"next":{"title":"任务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/task-orchestration"}}